	<key>readme</key>
	<string>Alfred workflow to generate a youtu.be share link from a YouTube URL.

Accepts watch?v=, youtu.be, /shorts/, /embed/, /live/, and music.youtube.com. The keyword is yts. With no argument, the workflow reads the clipboard.

The script filter always offers the plain https and youtu.be share links. Configure Workflow, Playlist IDs, takes one playlist per line as Name | PLAYLIST_ID. A line with only an ID is shown as that ID. Leave the field empty for no playlist rows.

https://github.com/chrisspiegl/alfred-youtube-share-link</string>
